!.claude/agents/README.md

# Gradle build outputs (web/ Kotlin PoC). Wrapper jars stay tracked.
web/.gradle/
web/build/
web/.kotlin/

# Gradle build outputs (intellij/ plugin). Wrapper jars stay tracked.
intellij/.gradle/
intellij/build/
intellij/.kotlin/
intellij/.intellijPlatform/

**/*.iml
.idea/
